  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Changing the lives of 250 indigenous Girl Students</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indigenous girls are facing many challenges particularly in rural India Most of the rural families don&apos;t encourage their girls to attend schools and colleges due to poverty and discrimination; parents also feel girls are burden to them. Parents are forced to decide to get their daughters married. They live in rural areas where there are no colleges for their higher education. Some are discontinuing their studies. Initiated  to bring change in the lives of girls through educational support.</narrative>
  </description>
